r_digged": 0, "digg_count": "3", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAkTFJc5Wl7gcaB6LEE6ac4H69aucwsqHgBNHaZfpGBdk", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAkTFJc5Wl7gcaB6LEE6ac4H69aucwsqHgBNHaZfpGBdk", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "667652725", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "华子", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_oQYODngzyhAFzAUkAYAVI3Ext4ADsCACrzJ9ef.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7666748334598439716", "create_time": 1785053952, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "南翔，我是广西三江县侗族这边的，我们村里的村民以前自发组织一个戏班子，那时我还12.3岁，他们也50多岁左右，他们虽然大多数是半文盲，但他们都是从老一辈代代相传学来的弹奏二胡等乐器，那个侗戏的曲子真的独一无二的好听，余音绕梁，后面随着时代的变迁，虽然国家给我们重修戏台，但再也没有听到那种远古厚朴的曲子表演了、他们现在也是70多岁了.如果还能组织他们表演一次，这个也就变成绝响了[流泪][流泪][流泪]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "9", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAARDRqSNFyagqBQkmCQI_tW7seBB-TtfDfOEjZAYpKovWPY5aGmo1KMOATauXaaqBv", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAARDRqSNFyagqBQkmCQI_tW7seBB-TtfDfOEjZAYpKovWPY5aGmo1KMOATauXaaqBv", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "Michellecake88", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "邵阳市蜜雪儿蛋糕店", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_d5f5a9026f21fb0ba39d253ba5370214.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "3", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7663692309389132579", "create_time": 1784342416, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "我就是山西寿阳的，一直以来寿阳就比较依赖煤炭 不能说寿阳 是整个山西都依赖煤炭 希望有越来越多的人可以来寿阳看看 好吃的猪头肉夹饼，也是著名的长寿之乡，希望越来越多的人可以来看看 也希望寿阳的文化越来越好", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "20", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAXQcKO9zeZTuCj5klOQB94RZ5nFT0TU8_ZcXKB1kQxu2H45cRsNqswX3-vn7wRo-r", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAXQcKO9zeZTuCj5klOQB94RZ5nFT0TU8_ZcXKB1kQxu2H45cRsNqswX3-vn7wRo-r", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "dyvm4nniut9n", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "月下独酌一杯白", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_o4DegACvIa9NBrABibChsQgLmYAFInKeNADgAA.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7664036404569604870", "create_time": 1784423491, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "你大爷还是你大爷，给七大爷点赞 [赞]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "78", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAA6b_4c_XAnBx6pbMpa8K9EqNOkAugP25VWZakMJRPjQF7EVyrzMKGNg_fzpq3bG0", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAA6b_4c_XAnBx6pbMpa8K9EqNOkAugP25VWZakMJRPjQF7EVyrzMKGNg_fzpq3bG0", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "jilifeng7236", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "Nieshifeng", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_ebf83fcacf3b4aa3ae649c9e6e51d67f.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7665121814363816762", "create_time": 1784675247, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "听着听着娓娓介绍的戏台，保护戏台的大爷，眼睛渐渐湿润，这就是文化传承，这就是文化的根基。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "5", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAATBglQdZZfa4Dw0wbaoDfR22RSc6aUBnwPjnXWlHzbAY", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAATBglQdZZfa4Dw0wbaoDfR22RSc6aUBnwPjnXWlHzbAY", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "1988167267", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "一叶知秋", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/aweme_default_avatar.png.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7663528965084054287", "create_time": 1784304384, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "古戏台是时代的珍宝，如若无人修缮保护，那它也会随着历史的演进和盗贼的偷窃被时代遗落，看到大爷拓印了戏台的花纹的时候真的感慨万千，就算有文物盗贼偷去了珍宝，也会有热爱它的人记录下它的一切。希望以后少有文物盗贼，希望戏可以在代代传承中得到延续[逞强落泪][逞强落泪][逞强落泪]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "6", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAwiHokUn2kC06qAK0ZOdZ3j2_jM8ZlLvTZ9qnBkgdjbA", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAwiHokUn2kC06qAK0ZOdZ3j2_jM8ZlLvTZ9qnBkgdjbA", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "zxn0715066", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "歇半霎（shà）", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_ogLPa1ChAEiIj2ioXQPiz7ARIyqAFA9gBAItX.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7664470202473874202", "create_time": 1784523533, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "这场看似尴尬的误会，从来不是愚昧与狭隘，而是最动人的乡土坚守。乡民们守着最朴素的执念，祖宗留下的东西，一片瓦、一块木都不能丢？、不能毁，用最笨拙也最坚守的方式，守住一方文脉根基。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "1", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAZInqBSq_rpksJYZr1rcTuJURdF7DuPqxStZM16wIbsA", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAZInqBSq_rpksJYZr1rcTuJURdF7DuPqxStZM16wIbsA", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "dymr3iarcu67", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "永远的传奇", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_a69063eb5c2e4516955c23567909ffe8.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7663651020392743726", "create_time": 1784332804, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "谢谢南翔，为我们山西省寿阳县修复古建，也希望更多看到的人莫要觉得大爷刚开始情绪激动。我也曾经回到小时候住的村子溜达，从倒塌的院墙翻进家看了看，那个村子已然变成了历史古建，整个村子都搬空了。也有一个大爷一直跟着我，问我是干什么的，我解释过后大爷不好意思的笑了笑，他们可能看起来总是很警惕，但也只是用内心的淳朴守护着自己长大又老去的故土，这里的一草一木一花一树他们都如数家珍。生于斯，长于斯，将来也要埋于斯。戏台重现，泪眼婆娑，念先生之恩，必铭记一生[感谢][感谢][感谢]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "9", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAMGQqlr6rWTnaNtD_gUYeKSzP45tMf-34XyNMosHIfxo", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAMGQqlr6rWTnaNtD_gUYeKSzP45tMf-34XyNMosHIfxo", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "ertiao_didi", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "二条弟弟", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_oAAAwLEQIEwopc8fUdFnhfHAAlsJpAABDCL9A0.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7663873261477937963", "create_time": 1784384546, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "寿阳县是我妈妈的老家，自从姥姥09年去世以后，我只17年回去扫过一次墓，这次南翔去这里，听到妈妈的老家话，我真的一下子泪崩了，小时候每次放寒暑假我都会回姥姥家，那里存留着我的快乐童年记忆[流泪]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "11", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAkdtV4e8BE5R_TloV35RwqND-c5XtSbCzikns78yBYr8", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAkdtV4e8BE5R_TloV35RwqND-c5XtSbCzikns78yBYr8", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "25843794", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "🚄🩷💙地下鐡☘️🥕", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_oIa7AjrgPO4VIBAEmAvwYGnOYiYAJiABA6gIU.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "4", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7663518272755712805", "create_time": 1784301893, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "山西的朋友，听说你们那一个村就有一个戏台，是真的吗？", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "153", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA92Hr4rxUkqBIcqP0BBgtlDKNh2Jk2szNu_1f9Rvd4aI", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA92Hr4rxUkqBIcqP0BBgtlDKNh2Jk2szNu_1f9Rvd4aI", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "569183708", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "偏偏喜欢你", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_55316b6233045083431d6c6e7bd91c4e.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "76", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7664069696689406757", "create_time": 1784430281, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "这方面就不得不夸一夸陕西了，我家在陕北的一个小乡村，即便到现在我们村的戏台也每年都在使用，我也不知道是不是古建筑，但是每年村里都会举办各种庙会，固定的时间段就会请戏台和戏班子来唱戏，几十年如一日从来没变过。一到庙会的时候，村里的老人还有年轻人都会去听戏，还有陕北说书之类的，都是非物质文化遗产[抱抱你][抱抱你]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "9", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAerje7YLPgGBnM1pHcQuZ_bfrJXotGsrFhtFOVG-DL7hhP-weFhrPt1wGgdx90mfr", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAerje7YLPgGBnM1pHcQuZ_bfrJXotGsrFhtFOVG-DL7hhP-weFhrPt1wGgdx90mfr", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "asdfghjkl4881", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "Secret", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_o0ecAGFEugE0hAWqA3AI94wF7fC0NDAoEDxCwc.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "2", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7663520665539379983", "create_time": 1784302454, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "目前是1.9万，这条视频一定一定会破200万。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "14", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAmW1qX5NM3aXZ9VlTT_8aOt6zgw5CFlB5-tZJno0EExwUAcTkNEjFkOMRwS_WYb18", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAmW1qX5NM3aXZ9VlTT_8aOt6zgw5CFlB5-tZJno0EExwUAcTkNEjFkOMRwS_WYb18", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "51886361213", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "黄子弘凡！", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_cf415533cd0446d8b61bc56e9c297798.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "10", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7663584421148803898", "create_time": 1784317298, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "我村里也有古戏台 小时后我还坐我爸肩上看戏呢 不过现在没人管它了好像", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "32", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAAb8COSic8Ye-C6x_slawDZ5SDkDDNrxnvwX0SxEE_2snKlzIPUtGzSrKCopD12SI", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAAb8COSic8Ye-C6x_slawDZ5SDkDDNrxnvwX0SxEE_2snKlzIPUtGzSrKCopD12SI", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "70473386100", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "宣望云", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_oUBeUpEg8rALRIEIBR7YewebAGG0JEAISANQRg.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "7", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7663521017655182107", "create_time": 1784302534, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "乡土中国……\n修复的不只是戏台，是烟火过往，是代代相传的乡土记忆[精选]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "8", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAcS8uodFEhY-YBWp_FbiVCcyzxynNsM8aO5ZL0vqQgrPVX55fIR6CDcRsR3w_5KjR", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAcS8uodFEhY-YBWp_FbiVCcyzxynNsM8aO5ZL0vqQgrPVX55fIR6CDcRsR3w_5KjR", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "33817838793", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "魔*魁", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_oM7DWBXLAqAQZAKUAJEFEhsfIEzf7Ae5mADMBU.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7663698028184896275", "create_time": 1784343748, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "谢谢南哥！！！[泣不成声][泣不成声][泣不成声][泣不成声]山西是每个村都有戏台，有的村戏台保存比较好还会有戏会[黑脸]戏会很热闹，跟我们这边赶会一样[黑脸]还会请上党梆子来唱戏[戳手手]而且我唯一赶的一场是暑假然后好多年轻人回村也在听，旁边两边还有光屏，然后光屏会亮台词[黑脸]不会有听不懂词的情况[黑脸]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "9", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAIG8g-q9rtS8KE-m154qsRUCPjAjn1dK1WsgERoP7WWdme8A-PeYocTWCDbPpwx4M", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAIG8g-q9rtS8KE-m154qsRUCPjAjn1dK1WsgERoP7WWdme8A-PeYocTWCDbPpwx4M", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "86360930160", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "私宅好有实力", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_osf9IAR7ywJfEApB3iCIQIySgAFJAqAKgwDNAE.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7663722871869227816", "create_time": 1784349531, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "感谢南翔，戏台子对于山西人真的是如同血脉一般，从小就知道戏台子对于一个村庄有多重要，每年只有戏台子唱戏的时候大家才会欢聚一堂，那个时候是最热闹的，这是中华传统文化流传至今的人文情怀", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "18", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA-lqrkRXMpxBwVpx-xJ5ExFO7iX2UFigHmh_2xgDGCpQ", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA-lqrkRXMpxBwVpx-xJ5ExFO7iX2UFigHmh_2xgDGCpQ", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "Incessantdream", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "岚", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_oUdQERimA7DsFQjhAABAIDE1e40ggCAAAMiFfO.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7663775641930466063", "create_time": 1784361818, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "开头的争吵谁都没错，我们那边太原晋中的方言说起普通话来总会带一点，尤其是一严肃起来，会有挑衅的感觉，出来上学也有人这么说过哈哈。但是老人家是真的特别爱戏台，对于山西的村民们来说，一个村一个大队的戏台可能就是村里的魂，从小姥姥就会抱着我听戏看戏，戏台塌了，村里的魂就有点散了，老人是真的怕外来的人偷走，感谢南翔老师让更多人看到古建筑修护古建保护古建[流泪]以后这个村会很热闹的", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "69", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA-XcF6G3s5KyiRhuBMWJgdbPBS_JDYhxS7M_Q71uf018", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA-XcF6G3s5KyiRhuBMWJgdbPBS_JDYhxS7M_Q71uf018", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "1216679693", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "浴乎沂", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_218cb19a796c4d54a610021a5fe357ea.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7663673735039419185", "create_time": 1784338089, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "很多人视频开头出现的老人因为“不讲道理”，但是不知道的是，正是村里这些默默无闻的人，保护了很多山西古建，这不是一个人，是一群人，是把山西散落农村的古建筑守护的很好，即使残根断垣，也在这些老人眼中视为珍宝…因为我周边很多这样的人，感谢他们的付出！", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "121", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA5Tcr3MvRv7SBi7hlc5wBZeTxoSCQLjeTCSULjL0w_HA", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA5Tcr3MvRv7SBi7hlc5wBZeTxoSCQLjeTCSULjL0w_HA", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "988301314", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "有个崽子叫豆豆", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_5af1d50cf2634f85a227c362ff5722e9.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7664429872899097381", "create_time": 1784514142, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "作为山西的孩子，每次看到这种视频都很感动。山西真的有很多古建筑，可是确实也没有钱，所以很多都得不到及时的修缮和宣传，所以破破烂烂的，但是政府也在努力维护修缮了！！现在越来越多的古建都可以重现当年的宏伟，希望大家多来山西玩[玫瑰]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "9", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAxCOPEHT3ydyOeQcTC8-aPwHaOOlf-mZ4lc-RDDgChHM", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAxCOPEHT3ydyOeQcTC8-aPwHaOOlf-mZ4lc-RDDgChHM", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "1792866147", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "✐FEI", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_o0AAgAB1iA0GFksIAeKqACdAHw2EIDAfg0kQui.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7664033387603182336", "create_time": 1784421831, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "中国从来不缺宏大的叙事，缺的正是大爷这样，把民族魂活成了日子、把守护化作了本能的普通人。他的‘脾气’，是对传统的敬畏；他的坚守，是文化自信最坚实的底气。在浮躁的时代，这种扎根泥土、挺直脊梁的‘中国魂’，恰是我们最需要的力量。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "22", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAHqx6H48kJfRYel4aBrYRHsjl8lgW0Yw-ycyK-z25G88", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAHqx6H48kJfRYel4aBrYRHsjl8lgW0Yw-ycyK-z25G88", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "137072357", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "嘻蹈典京", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_oslJ2spEA59nAIYE8CFqAqCDgeCZAAqnfaiAGv.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7663672097085145905", "create_time": 1784337709, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "事实是这些年来，山西的古建筑里面确实被偷走了数不清的东西，最离谱的是，我们村的大戏台前面的两头石狮子，那个可大了，有差不多3米高呢，一个得有一两吨重，不知道年份多久了，反正我爷爷小时候，那对狮子就在那立着呢，就在一晚上被偷走了，值得一提的是，我们村的大戏台是村中心，最繁华的地方，村子里4000多号人，都没看住，好像凭空蒸发了一样", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "57", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAHqLXVHMdxltjK5mArpt9MOKkvjmLeIzP64AtSSLz5PCnoOF4tdWc4n3KZhHcWFIp", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAHqLXVHMdxltjK5mArpt9MOKkvjmLeIzP64AtSSLz5PCnoOF4tdWc4n3KZhHcWFIp", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "63564411746", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "🍁🍁🍁", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_o4PACIM8QWBgDAiq3AALAEa847Q6EByiEyipv.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "2", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7663767681333887790", "create_time": 1784359963, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "以前山西文物被偷盗的特别厉害，我们村老奶奶庙正殿下面埋的宝贝，和庙对面老戏台都被偷盗了。听我奶说，偷盗贼大半夜偷盗，有时候发现不了，有时候发现了半夜全村起来敲锣抓贼。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "68", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAc3Wswd2_MoQD3FEGBQakozuL7VwUpNjo2k63aZ7lADRGvbeVQupV9nHhPBOc2xk_", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAc3Wswd2_MoQD3FEGBQakozuL7VwUpNjo2k63aZ7lADRGvbeVQupV9nHhPBOc2xk_", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "57496666314", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "小黄油拿铁", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_dad3db9bb8cc894b6636cee432f073be.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7663569968227730214", "create_time": 1784313938, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "南翔，你是个有心的主播。看了很多你的非遗系列，深受感动。我也在山西，也认养了一座古建筑，一座明末清初的观音庙，实在太理解其中的艰辛了，里面已经基本废了，什么都没有，前后花了80万，还没修完呢，为和你同样的愿望点赞！", "is_author_digged": true, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "646", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAANPjcC8Hvn1yk6wNSxuoXMe7dAeGYCU7imoajv2REVIw", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAANPjcC8Hvn1yk6wNSxuoXMe7dAeGYCU7imoajv2REVIw", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "591612952", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "全能玩家Berny", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_b775bf951bd0d81698c48130d6017b27.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "2", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7663523004995044139", "create_time": 1784302996, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "下村工作时听闻村里来了一个三千万的大网红出资修戏台，没想到在村委会偶遇到了，为人谦和、凡事亲力亲为，作为同龄人，佩服你把这股闯劲用在了给乡亲们修戏台上，乡村振兴需要这样的‘流量’变‘留量’，替我们寿阳谢谢你。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "990", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAdCz0io0MyPoxV50KqCAzAzsoKzW3OuXh1HXVISqamQI", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAdCz0io0MyPoxV50KqCAzAzsoKzW3OuXh1HXVISqamQI", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "938834974", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "@🌈一只小景🌻", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/mosaic-legacy_3164300033f649cc0a6f4.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "4", "last_modify_ts": 1794420011007}, {"comment_id": "7705224299389911850", "create_time": 1794012335, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7663490009302977846", "content": "大爷真棒", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "0", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAX2_HFi0cmkG87bpaHWSeBId3zc2ic_Gt-OIS2fzArxHQNyoV7JJz_He7o2GMiq8Z", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAX2_HFi0cmkG87bpaHWSeBId3zc2ic_Gt-OIS2fzArxHQNyoV7JJz_He7o2GMiq8Z", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "above777", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "G-F", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_1c216937bcd98a5a44d3f070e01cf15a.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment